{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12225120","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12225120","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1222512001:1":{"text":"Oh, it's you lot!","source_cn":"是你们几个。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7579DDBB6E11F78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222512002:0":{"text":"Hey, Bols. We'd like to stay in your best room tonight. Can we head up now, or do we need to wait?","source_cn":"波尔斯，我们想再住一晚高级客房。现在可以上去吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CCF3765251DFFFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222512003:1":{"text":"It's already been prepared. The Whispers will cover all your expenses here. For every day you're in Rustport, they pay me an extra day for the room.","source_cn":"随意。血薇帮替你们包下了，你们在锈锚港多待一天，他们就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29D1E8DA559396D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222512004:1":{"text":"Anytime you wanna stay here, just head on up.","source_cn":"以后想住，不用打招呼。直接推门进去就行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12296EF7DD439583","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222512005:1":{"text":"Really? Sonja is so generous!","source_cn":"真的吗？索尼娅好慷慨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B9A9EF21FC802CE","variant_stat